	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratia Christi tecum.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><persName>Casparus</persName> ille tuus die quinta <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>septembris mihi tuam reddidit epistolam cum principis <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>honorario munere, quod statim conabar offerre <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>ingressus aulam, sed propter strepitum euntium <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ac redeuntium et nobilium et aulicorum impeditus sum.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>A merenda idem rursum tentavi, feliciterque cessit; <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>nam inter aulicos conciliarios a duce <persName ref="p1546">Christophoro</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>missos sedebat.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Obtuli, recepit lectaque epistola <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>reddidit mihi et literas et libellos mandans custo<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>dię meę ac fidei, ut post nuptias referrem; tum <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>se liberatum a strepitu velle tibi respondere etc.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Proinde agit tibi gratias ingentes petens a <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>te et symmystis tuis sedulam precationem fieri <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ad deum, ne ceptum et institutum iamque diu pro<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>telatum matrimonium Satanę versutis interturbetur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Quam sit magnificus adparatus ex serio, auro <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>et argento poculisque, item quot <persName>Apitii</persName>, qui curent <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>culinam, paucis significare non possum; <persName>Casparus</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>omnia significabit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Expectatur in crastinum dux <placeName ref="l572">Wir<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>tembergensis</placeName> cum ducentis equitibus, comitibus et nobilibus; <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>non minori adparatu aderit <persName ref="p18935">Wolfgangus</persName>, dux <lb xml:id="p1z22"/><placeName ref="l2100">Bipentinus</placeName>, duo Palatini, marchiones <placeName ref="l1898">Badenses</placeName> duo <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>item et ille, quem vocant a <placeName>Hunsruck</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Tyrannus <lb xml:id="p1z24"/><persName ref="p20318">Henricus</persName> <placeName ref="l1041">Brunsvicensis</placeName> invitatus; sed anser ille <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>metuet se miscere oloribus.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Plures comites, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>comes a <placeName>Stauffen</placeName>, a <placeName>Sultz</placeName>, a <placeName ref="l512">Tubinga</placeName>, ab <placeName ref="l2313">Hanau</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>a <placeName>Bitsch</placeName>, a <placeName>Furstemberg</placeName> et complures alii, quorum <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>nomina epistolaris angustia non sinit recensere.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Finitis nuptiis singula ordine ad te per<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>scribam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Nuptię erunt 11. huius mensis etc.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p2z4"/>Ut valeam cum fratribus, ex <persName>Caspare</persName>, qui omnes <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>te salutant.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Tu igitur vale et vicissim saluta tuos fratres.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/><placeName ref="l411">Richenvillę</placeName> 6. septembris anno 1555.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">T[uus] <persName ref="p1010">Erbius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Eximio viro pietate ac eruditione d. <lb xml:id="p2z7"/><persName ref="p495">Henrycho Bullingero</persName>, primario et theolo<lb xml:id="p2z8"/>go ac concionatori apud <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinos</placeName>, fratri.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
